  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3115.02 Maintaining Insurance. The insurance required pursuant to this section shall be effective at all times when an approved drivers’ school is in operation.\n\nSource. #9568, eff 10-17-09 (from Saf-C 3118.04); ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (formerly Saf-C 3119.04) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100)",
